      "worked": "Use exact acute-angle values, supplementary-angle relationships and the unit circle.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin30^\\circ&=\\frac12\\\\\\sin150^\\circ&=\\sin30^\\circ\\\\\\sin150^\\circ&=\\frac12\\\\\\sin90^\\circ&=1\\\\\\cos30^\\circ&=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\\\\\cos120^\\circ&=-\\cos60^\\circ\\\\\\cos120^\\circ&=-\\frac12\\\\\\cos135^\\circ&=-\\cos45^\\circ\\\\\\cos135^\\circ&=-\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\end{align*}$$",
